  "stageId": "main_04-04",
  "title": "Nerves of Steel",
  "storyCode": "4-4",
  "avgTag": "Before Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_04-04_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "42bfa4e1fd3c911a75a272b38f63b439431e38459c33d2e69f9e73dc85d08e45",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第三十二关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "Hope I didn't keep you waiting. The L.G.D. meeting took a little longer than expected.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "Don't worry about it, Madam Ch'en.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "(She looks like nothing ever happened...)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "How's the situation?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "Our scout team has already sent back some information.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "I went through it and picked out a few things that might interest you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "Ah, Inspector Hoshiguma...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "text": "Don't worry about me. I'm just going to listen in.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "Continue, Amiya. It's fine.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "Very well. We managed to get a lead from some Infected...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "The scout team has already confirmed that there are several Reunion hideouts in Lungmen's residential district.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "And?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "A number of Reunion squads are already planning to launch an attack against Lungmen's defenses.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "We even found an infiltration channel that Reunion had been using.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "Hah. Such arrogance.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "They seem to be underestimating the L.G.D.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "What about the ruins of Chernobog?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "Rhodes Island dispatched multiple recon squads there.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "While most of the residents were gone, we did find many Reunion members still active there.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "One team even had more than three encounters with Reunion forces.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "However, based upon the intel we have, we are unable to conclusively link the movements in the city to any broader Reunion operations...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "But I would recommend choosing this city as one of our important operation targets in the future.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "...I see.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "Hoshiguma, help bring me my forms. Third drawer on the left side of my desk.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "text": "Right now? Sure thing.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "Continue.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "Mm, to summarize...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "Rhodes Island suggests a joint operation to completely eliminate the remaining Reunion forces in Lungmen.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "No good.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "The L.G.D. will not permit it.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "...What? Madam Ch'en...?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "I said, no.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "You... are an Infected.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "If you carry out any more missions in the slums, you'll only cause greater disorder.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "This is our decision.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "But--",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "Ah, excuse me, I need to take this call...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "This is Amiya.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "text": "Is, is this Amiya?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "...! Jessica?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jessica",
      "text": "Yes, Jessica here...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "Are you on a stealth mission? I can barely hear you...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jessica",
      "text": "We found them in the city ruins...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jessica",
      "text": "Reunion's leaders...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jessica",
      "text": "There are... two of them.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "What?!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "text": "So, you fled back here with your tail between your legs?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "I am no mongrel like you and your lowly kind.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "text": "...If not for the fact that you completed your mission, I would have added two more scars to your filthy face.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "Didn't you lose all your limbs in that explosion? I'd feel sorry making a kid like you put makeup on my face with your mouth.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "text": "Pah.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "But let's set this aside for now... It's not doing either of us any good.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "text": "I'll admit to that much.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "text": "Then, have they taken the bait?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "Surely. Let's just see if that old flag-waver can bring back the real goods.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "Speaking of which, you're pretty scared of that old timer, aren't you?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "text": "I'm already in a bad mood.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "Oh my, sorry 'bout that.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "But that's just before we land the catch, right?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "text": "How about we put aside our differences for the time being?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "text": "Tch. Fine.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "text": "I'll deal with the small fry first.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "text": "Rhodes Island, I know you're there.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "text": "...It's impossible to hide from me.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "text": "Jessica, don't!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "text": "It could be a trap...!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jessica",
      "text": "He found us! We have to...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jessica",
      "text": "If we defeat the enemy leader... We have to...!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "text": "Huh. They really were here.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "text": "Where'd you come from, little kitty~?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "text": "You can't just treat this place like your playground.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "text": "Hey, you bunch.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "Yessir!!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "text": "Before we get to feast upon the most sumptuous prey...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "text": "Help yourself to the appetizers.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "Ohhh... Ohhhhh! !",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frostleaf",
      "text": "Tsk...!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
